        // Get whether specific colliders are currently touching or not.
        ///<summary>Checks whether the passed Colliders are in contact or not.</summary>
        ///<remarks>It is important to understand that checking whether Colliders are touching or not is performed against the last physics engine update; that is the state of touching Colliders at that time. If you have just added a new <see cref="Collider2D" /> or have moved a <see cref="Collider2D" /> but a physics update has not yet taken place then the Colliders will not be shown as touching. This function returns the same collision results as the physics collision or trigger callbacks.</remarks>
