        ///<summary>Casts a capsule against Colliders in the Scene, returning all Colliders that contact with it.</summary>
        ///<remarks>A CapsuleCast is conceptually like dragging a capsule through the Scene in a particular direction.  Any object making contact with the capsule can be detected and reported.
        ///
        ///This function is similar to the <see cref="CapsuleCast" /> function but instead of detecting just the first Collider that is hit, an array of all Colliders along the path of the capsule is returned. The Colliders in the array are sorted in order of distance from the origin point. The layerMask can be used to detect objects selectively only on certain layers (this allows you to apply the detection only to enemy characters, for example).
