    ///<remarks>The RaycastHit2D struct is used to return results from many 2D physics queries. It contains many pieces of information about a detection result including the <see cref="Collider2D" /> detected along with extra detail such as the contact point, the distance traversed to that contact point, the contact normal at that contact point etc.
