        ///
        ///The rotational inertia is automatically calculated based on the Rigidbody's <see cref="mass" /> position relative to the <see cref="centerOfMass" />.  It can also be specified explicitly by setting this property in the same way <see cref="mass" /> can be set.</remarks>
