        ///<summary>All the <see cref="Collider2D" /> shapes attached to the <see cref="Rigidbody2D" /> are cast into the Scene starting at each Collider position ignoring the Colliders attached to the same <see cref="Rigidbody2D" />.</summary>
        ///<remarks>This function will take all the <see cref="Collider2D" /> shapes attached to the <see cref="Rigidbody2D" /> and cast them into the Scene starting at the Collider position in the specified <c>direction</c> for an optional <c>distance</c> and return the results in the provided <c>results</c> array.
