        ///**NOTE**: Additionally, this will also detect other Collider(s) overlapping the start position. In this case the cast shape will be starting inside another Collider and may not intersect the Collider surface. This means that the collision normal cannot be calculated in which case the collision normal returned is set to the inverse of the <c>direction</c> vector being tested.</remarks>
